  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 45997371392
    m_Localized: 'Each card contains information such as cost, effect, and type.

      The
      card''s type is shown at the top right, and each character has three different
      types.

      You can use a card by dragging it onto a target.

      You can
      end your turn at any time by pressing the Turn End button.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168156475392
    m_Localized: '


      Mana and cards are refilled at the start of each turn.

      Click
      the icon at the top left to check your character''s deck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186011627520
    m_Localized: 'You can view unlocked cards through "Dorothy''s Book" at the top
      right.

      You can also adjust the volume or return to the title screen
      from the settings menu during an adventure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 200611999744
    m_Localized: "\nEach character has two \"stances\".\nYou can freely switch stances
      each turn as long as you haven\u2019t used that character's cards yet.\nYou
      can check each stance's effects by hovering over the button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4084201959424
    m_Localized: '

      : Attack and Defense

      : In Guard state,  immune to
      damage

      : In Stunned state, cannot act'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3748351455232
    m_Localized: 'Cards have various effects.

      Effects currently applied to
      a character are shown below their health bar.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 220631412736
    m_Localized: 'You can view usable cards through "Dorothy''s Book" at the top
      right.

      You can also adjust the volume and select the resolution from
      the settings menu.

      You can return to the title screen during an adventure
      as well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 232937500672
    m_Localized: 'You can view usable cards through "Dorothy''s Book" at the top
      right.

      You can also adjust the volume and select the resolution from
      the settings menu.

      You can return to the title screen during an adventure
      as well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 243196768256
    m_Localized: 'You can unlock new cards each time you start a new adventure.

      Use
      the loot you earned in battle to unlock cards of the type you want.

      Buttons
      for card types that can''t be unlocked will appear blacked out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276424044544
    m_Localized: "Congratulations! You have cleared all currently implemented stages.\nIf
      you start the adventure again, you can play with new cards.\nThank you for
      playing \u2014 we hope you had a great time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592599068672
    m_Localized: '<sprite=1>   : Flame          <sprite=2>   : Frost           <sprite=0>  
      : Nature

      <sprite=4>   : Prayer         <sprite=5>   : Holy Power    
      <sprite=3>   : Baptism

      <sprite=7>   : Slash          <sprite=8>   :
      Strike         <sprite=6>   : Guard'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 891279650816
    m_Localized: 'Each type of card has a corresponding type that enhances its effect
      when linked.

      Cards that are eligible for combo effects are marked with
      a special border effect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
